  "translation": "Na ol i singautim ol raaitman bilong king long nambawan mun, long teldin-pela de bilong em, na ol i raaitim olsem evri samting we Haman i bin tokim — long ol satrap bilong king, na long ol gavana we i stap long wanwan kantri, na long ol bikman bilong wanwan lain manmeri — long wanwan kantri olsem raait bilong en, na long wanwan lain manmeri olsem tok ples bilong ol; ol i raaitim long nem bilong king Achashverosh, na ol i sekim wantaim rin bilong king.",
